/P 535 0 R
/T (Imagine two men meeting the same woman. One constantly tries to appear impressive: he mentions expensive places, interrupts with stories, and watches her reactions for approval. The other is equally ambitious but does not need the conversation to prove it. He talks about what he is working on, asks about what she enjoys, disagrees comfortably when they differ, and lets silence exist. The second man is not using a technique. His personality is doing the communicating.)
/E (Imagine two men meeting the same woman. One constantly tries to appear impressive: he mentions expensive places, interrupts with stories, and watches her reactions for approval. The other is equally ambitious but does not need the conversation to prove it. He talks about what he is working on, asks about what she enjoys, disagrees comfortably when they differ, and lets silence exist. The second man is not using a technique. His personality is doing the communicating.)
