/E (Restraint is not ignoring messages to create scarcity, pretending not to care, or withdrawing affection after intimacy. Those behaviors are designed to create insecurity. Healthy space comes from having a life that continues whether or not someone is currently available.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
