/E (When youstep back, do not spend the next week monitoring whether she notices. Put the attention somewhere real: friends, work, health, learning, family, hobbies, or people who are reciprocating. Otherwise you have changed the outward behavior while keeping the same inward obsession.)
/Pg 41 0 R
