/Title (Choose three qualities you already possess and three you want to strengthen. Then translate each quality into observable behavior. 'Confident' might become 'state my preference without apologizing for it.' 'Warm' might become 'ask one follow-up question and actually listen to the answer.' 'Interesting' might become 'maintain hobbies and projects that I would pursue even if nobody noticed.' The point is to build traits through evidence rather than labels.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4188 0 R
/Next 4196 0 R
>>
endobj
4196 0 obj
<<
/Title (Imagine two men meeting the same woman. One constantly tries to appear impressive: he mentions expensive places, interrupts with stories, and watches her reactions for approval. The other is equally ambitious but does not need the conversation to prove it. He talks about what he is working on, asks about what she enjoys, disagrees comfortably when they differ, and lets silence exist. The second man is not using a technique. His personality is doing the communicating.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4188 0 R
/Prev 4195 0 R
/First 4199 0 R
/Last 4199 0 R
/Count -1
>>
