/Title (Chasing often begins as a response to uncertainty: one message goes unanswered, so another is sent; a conversation becomes quieter, so the person tries harder; interest feels ambiguous, so every small signal is analyzed. A better response is to return to your actual life. Finish the workday. Meet a friend. Exercise. Read. Continue the plans you already had. If the conversation resumes, engage normally.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4202 0 R
>>
endobj
