<<
/Title (Confidence is one of the most requested and least understood traits in this entire subject. Here's a working definition that actually holds up: confidence is comfort with the possibility of rejection. Arrogance is the belief that you're owed acceptance. They are frequently confused because both can look bold from a distance  but only one of them is actually attractive, and it isn't the one built on entitlement.)
/Dest [62 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4291 0 R
/First 4303 0 R
/Last 4304 0 R
/Count -2
/Next 4305 0 R
>>
